    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$dignified_intro",
        "key": "$dignified_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey\u2014Hey! Is anyone here?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's gotten really dark... I just walked past the school, the cake shop, and the tailor shop that Rolena's mom used to run...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I keep going straight, I'll be in the next district.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dammit... This road is barely walkable. Those nutjobs with the masks... Everything's changed all of a sudden, thanks to them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yuri! Yuri, where are you?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "We were together just a moment ago... I was just trying to get us some water that we can drink!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yuri's the youngest, and he's the most hurt. Where could he have gone by himself? Right, his wound was still bleeding... If I look out for the smell of blood... Uhh... It smells like blood everywhere.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh, it stinks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I can't throw up. It took Oleg so long to find us dinner in the ruins.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yuri\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_storehouse",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "*Whimpers*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that sound coming from behind the wall? A small animal, maybe?  Hmm, probably not. Everything that was alive in this street ran away a long time ago. We're the only ones left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "*Whimpers*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$leaveshake",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There it is again. It doesn't sound like the wind. Could it really be...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yuri! Yuri, is that you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "It quieted down. Am I too far away? What was behind the wall again...? The department store's old storeroom?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "The storeroom's been empty the whole time, and the adults would never let us close to it. Oleg even said before that he'd help us sneak inside one day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did Yuri come in here by himself? It's so dark... I can't see through the gaps. Dammit, I guess I'm gonna have to climb inside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's even darker in here. My face's all sticky... Is it the rain that dripped in from outside? Urgh, it smells...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now I remember... The girls in school said there's something weird inside the storeroom.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's gotta be fake.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... I've already seen so many weird things going on these past few days...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, don't think about that right now, Anton. Don't be scared. You still need to find Yuri.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "*Whimpers*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$leaveshake",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone's crying! Someone's crying over on that side! Now I heard it this time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yuri, is that you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anton...? Anton?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, it's me. I'm here. You don't need to be scared no more. I'll climb over there. Give me a second.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Help... Help me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hang in there. I'm almost there. What happened anyway? Why'd you run this far on your own all a sudden?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't your leg hurt...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uhh... *Sobs*... T-There was a monster...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "A monster? What are you talking about, Yuri? Do you have a fever?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "A monster... brought me here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "The monster you're talking about... What does it look like?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I couldn't get a good look... I think it had black claws... And it had red eyes! It stared at me. I-I was so scared, I didn't know what was going on at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Black claws and red eyes? I think I heard of that before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh yeah, that's the ghost story that Lina from school talked about, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah... Lina said... She said any kids that don't go to bed at night will get a visit from the monster.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "It'll keep staring at you, and if your eyes are open and lock onto her red eyes, your soul will get sucked out right away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll turn into something like a marionette. You'll climb off your bed with the monster and follow it outside and onto the street. Then you'll keep following it... until you reach its nest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "There, the monster will hang you up on the eaves... Just like how we hang sausages at home...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "And when it's hungry... It'll come suck your blood, one mouthful after another until your body's bone dry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sobs*... Anton, I can't possibly have...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop it. You're scaring yourself. This is just something the adults made up to get us to go to bed early, I'm sure of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "R-Really?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, think about it. Did it hang you up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... There's something holding my leg... Somewhere up high...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "What?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "So... What Lina said's actually real, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sobs*... Anton... I don't wanna be eaten by the monster...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's okay. I'll be there soon. We just gotta be fast. I'll carry you back before that mon... Before whatever it is comes back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah... N-No... Anton, stay away! Go back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can see you now, Yuri\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.6,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "What's this?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_171_bldsk_1",
